ocal cultures.", "encoded_message": "Widespread sightseeing is able to possess meaningful consequences upon community heritages. A single relating to the foremost outcomes is the trading and marketization of established routines and practices. Given that vacationers converge into in vogue venues, community-based ethnic customs regularly develop into draws which are presented exclusively for the objective of diverting visitors. This can lead to the dilution or distortion of authentic cultural expressions. Additionally, mass tourism can also contribute to the loss of local identity as communities prioritize catering to tourists over preserving their own heritage. As a result, it is crucial to promote responsible tourism practices that respect and support the preservation of local cultures.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 3.37, "secret_key_generation": 106.58}, "decoding_time": 0.0003039836883544922, "decoded_message": "1010001101000110011101110010111010110110111010010110011001100011", "error_message": ""}